01:05:52,352 --> 01:05:53,588
But Knight said,

850
01:05:54,556 --> 01:05:57,157
if the host dies,
the virus dies.

851
01:05:57,491 --> 01:05:59,594
And we don't even
know how long that is.

852
01:06:08,035 --> 01:06:10,237
Sagan has all the
long range equipment.

853
01:06:12,574 --> 01:06:16,007
If we don't make it back,
they're going to start digging

854
01:06:16,009 --> 01:06:18,746
in that dirt looking for answers

855
01:06:20,113 --> 01:06:22,282
and it'll spread like wildfire.

856
01:06:26,688 --> 01:06:28,188
The humvee.

857
01:06:30,057 --> 01:06:31,960
It has a radio
that should work.

858
01:06:32,326 --> 01:06:33,293
All right.

859
01:06:34,495 --> 01:06:37,162
But we agree right now,

860
01:06:37,164 --> 01:06:39,366
no human contact
until we get cleared.

861
01:06:40,267 --> 01:06:41,636
And if one of us tries...

862
01:06:43,671 --> 01:06:45,005
He eats a bullet.

863
01:06:48,075 --> 01:06:49,409
It's not about
the money anymore.

864
01:06:51,144 --> 01:06:52,079
Not anymore.

865
01:06:58,385 --> 01:07:00,588
[Military drums]

866
01:07:35,222 --> 01:07:37,559
[Nature sounds]

867
01:07:44,632 --> 01:07:45,600
All right.

868
01:07:47,535 --> 01:07:49,069
I figure if we--

869
01:07:51,405 --> 01:07:52,574
Fuck.

870
01:07:52,740 --> 01:07:53,675
What?

871
01:08:00,782 --> 01:08:03,283
[Quiet, ominous music]

872
01:08:38,586 --> 01:08:39,754
You know,

873
01:08:41,321 --> 01:08:43,457
they never tell you
when you're young...

874
01:08:45,292 --> 01:08:47,595
One day you're
going to get tired,

875
01:08:50,665 --> 01:08:52,634
and you'll never stop

876
01:08:53,801 --> 01:08:55,502
being tired.

877
01:08:58,573 --> 01:09:00,140
Don't make me do this, man.

878
01:09:02,309 --> 01:09:03,308
I'd do it myself,

879
01:09:03,310 --> 01:09:04,378
but, um...

880
01:09:06,213 --> 01:09:08,215
You can't trust me with that.

881
01:09:20,293 --> 01:09:21,729
There has to be another way.

882
01:09:22,597 --> 01:09:24,431
Maybe I can tie you
up or something.

883
01:09:26,734 --> 01:09:28,502
We can't take that chance.

884
01:09:36,343 --> 01:09:37,411
Please.

885
01:09:48,589 --> 01:09:51,491
It's been an honor, boss.

886
01:10:01,969 --> 01:10:02,904
[Click]

887
01:10:07,575 --> 01:10:08,576
Wait.

888
01:10:11,512 --> 01:10:12,446
I don't...

889
01:10:14,314 --> 01:10:15,983
I don't feel different.

890
01:10:17,752 --> 01:10:20,420
Shouldn't I feel... something?

891
01:10:22,724 --> 01:10:24,324
How the hell am I
supposed to know?

892
01:10:34,234 --> 01:10:34,969
I think... [Sniff]

893
01:10:37,572 --> 01:10:38,773
I think we should wait.

894
01:10:41,241 --> 01:10:42,877
[Rhythmic music]

895
01:10:57,759 --> 01:10:59,426
[Gunshots]

896
01:11:09,369 --> 01:11:11,639
[Gunshots]

897
01:11:39,033 --> 01:11:40,034
[Gunshot, yell]

898
01:11:42,703 --> 01:11:43,805
[Splash]

899
01:11:59,554 --> 01:12:00,487
Shit.

900
01:12:15,570 --> 01:12:16,469
[Splash]

901
01:12:47,735 --> 01:12:50,071
[Low, tense music]

902
01:13:44,992 --> 01:13:45,927
[Wood chop]

903
01:13:55,002 --> 01:13:56,503
[Chop]
What's wrong with that thing?

904
01:13:56,837 --> 01:13:59,874
It's the signal... I think.

905
01:14:00,041 --> 01:14:02,473
Why don't you put that
thing down and look at nature

906
01:14:02,475 --> 01:14:04,444
through your own
eyes for a change?

907
01:14:05,613 --> 01:14:06,781
How's that dinner coming?

908
01:14:07,048 --> 01:14:09,717
I'm wasting away over here.

909
01:14:10,084 --> 01:14:12,119
Maybe if you helped,
you'd be eating by now.

910
01:14:12,485 --> 01:14:13,587
I'll help.

911
01:14:15,656 --> 01:14:16,555
Careful with the fire.

912
01:14:16,557 --> 01:14:17,625
I know, Mom. [Chop]

913
01:14:22,029 --> 01:14:23,965
Uh, as long as you girls
are helping,

914
01:14:24,131 --> 01:14:25,700
I could use a
hand over here.

915
01:14:26,801 --> 01:14:30,604
I... am not chopping wood.

916
01:14:31,872 --> 01:14:34,474
Like I... would trust
you with an axe.

917
01:14:34,976 --> 01:14:36,075
Whatever.

918
01:14:36,077 --> 01:14:38,579
Seriously, phone down,
the fire needs more wood.

919
01:14:38,913 --> 01:14:39,981
[Chop]

920
01:14:42,683 --> 01:14:43,651
Thanks, kiddo.

921
01:14:46,721 --> 01:14:47,922
[Music boom]

922
01:14:49,924 --> 01:14:51,258
Please, you gotta help me.

923
01:14:52,827 --> 01:14:53,694
You don't understand.

924
01:14:53,861 --> 01:14:54,762
He's gone crazy.

925
01:14:55,196 --> 01:14:56,496
We have to get out of here.

926
01:14:56,797 --> 01:14:57,732
Oh, no.

927
01:14:58,899 --> 01:14:59,732
We have to get...

928
01:14:59,734 --> 01:15:01,202
Please. Please help me!
[Gunshot]

929
01:15:01,902 --> 01:15:02,801
Ah!

930
01:15:02,803 --> 01:15:03,637
[Scream]

931
01:15:12,980 --> 01:15:13,881
Shit!

932
01:15:14,982 --> 01:15:15,916
No!
- Put it down!

933
01:15:16,617 --> 01:15:17,685
Put it down!

934
01:15:17,852 --> 01:15:18,719
Ok.

935
01:15:20,521 --> 01:15:21,222
Move away.

936
01:15:25,626 --> 01:15:26,761
Is there a road nearby?

937
01:15:27,128 --> 01:15:27,993
What?

938
01:15:27,995 --> 01:15:28,896
A road!

939
01:15:29,063 --> 01:15:29,864
That way.

940
01:15:31,932 --> 01:15:32,900
Give me your keys.

941
01:15:33,200 --> 01:15:34,168
What?!

942
01:15:34,535 --> 01:15:35,936
Give me your keys! Now!

943
01:15:36,570 --> 01:15:37,538
Ok.

944
01:15:37,772 --> 01:15:38,706
Please.

945
01:15:43,144 --> 01:15:44,111
It's okay.

946
01:15:44,545 --> 01:15:45,279
Look.

947
01:15:46,647 --> 01:15:48,149
I wasn't going to do anything.

948
01:15:49,717 --> 01:15:51,252
Jesus! Did he touch you?

949
01:15:51,619 --> 01:15:53,187
No. He just ran past us all.

950
01:15:53,554 --> 01:15:54,655
He didn't hurt her, I swear.

951
01:15:55,556 --> 01:15:56,624
It's okay.

952
01:15:57,224 --> 01:15:58,092
It's okay.

953
01:15:58,692 --> 01:15:59,528
I'm sorry.

954
01:15:59,727 --> 01:16:00,594
No! [Gunshots]

955
01:16:05,066 --> 01:16:06,033
Oh, God.

956
01:16:53,747 --> 01:16:55,049
[Door latch]

957
01:17:13,667 --> 01:17:15,736
[Door slamming]

958
01:17:20,841 --> 01:17:22,643
Ahhhh!

959
01:17:28,082 --> 01:17:29,014
This...

960
01:17:29,016 --> 01:17:31,018
This isn't fun anymore.

961
01:17:31,785 --> 01:17:32,920
I don't know...[Coughing]

962
01:17:33,888 --> 01:17:35,856
I'm starting to enjoy it.
[Hard hits]

963
01:17:40,127 --> 01:17:41,095
Come on.

964
01:17:41,262 --> 01:17:42,296
Stay with me.

965
01:17:42,663 --> 01:17:43,395
Hey hey hey.

966
01:17:43,397 --> 01:17:45,299
Don't pass out, don't pass out.

967
01:17:47,168 --> 01:17:48,102
Look at you.

968
01:17:48,335 --> 01:17:49,370
Look at you!

969
01:17:50,304 --> 01:17:52,173
All that anger and doubt.

970
01:17:53,674 --> 01:17:55,776
See those innocent
people you just murdered?

971
01:17:56,410 --> 01:17:59,013
Huh? You didn't really know,
did you? [Chuckle]

972
01:18:02,049 --> 01:18:03,150
Let me tell you a secret.

973
01:18:04,418 --> 01:18:07,821
It doesn't even matter.

974
01:18:10,724 --> 01:18:12,126
Oh, speaking of which.

975
01:18:18,232 --> 01:18:19,200
Remember this?

976
01:18:21,435 --> 01:18:22,469
[Gunshot]

977
01:18:29,276 --> 01:18:31,412
It happens faster
than you think.

978
01:18:40,321 --> 01:18:42,823
You're not gonna get
far on that leg, though.

979
01:18:48,462 --> 01:18:49,363
You take five.

980
01:18:50,731 --> 01:18:51,899
And I'll meet you in town.

981
01:18:52,099 --> 01:18:53,200
All right?

982
01:18:54,468 --> 01:18:55,736
You can do it.

983
01:18:56,870 --> 01:18:58,038
And this...

984
01:18:58,472 --> 01:19:00,741
is just in case anybody
tries to stop you.

985
01:19:14,021 --> 01:19:16,390
[Reloading]

986
01:19:27,234 --> 01:19:29,770
[Intense music, whoosh,
alien sounds]

987
01:19:42,816 --> 01:19:44,184
Ahhh!

988
01:19:48,155 --> 01:19:50,124
[Explosions]

989
01:19:54,395 --> 01:19:56,096
[Screams]

990
01:20:02,136 --> 01:20:03,937
[Heartbeat]

991
01:20:23,824 --> 01:20:24,825
[Moaning]

992
01:20:26,594 --> 01:20:27,828
[Grunting]

993
01:21:24,652 --> 01:21:25,620
Current...

994
01:21:26,887 --> 01:21:27,622
Current!

995
01:21:39,366 --> 01:21:41,368
[Ominous music]

996
01:22:23,944 --> 01:22:25,112
[Sizzle, groan]

997
01:22:27,481 --> 01:22:29,684
[Boom, sizzle]

998
01:22:48,001 --> 01:22:49,369
[Distant boom]

999
01:23:12,226 --> 01:23:13,193
Finally...

1000
01:23:21,669 --> 01:23:24,004
[Military drums rising]

1001
01:24:11,385 --> 01:24:12,820
[Window rolling down]

1002
01:24:15,489 --> 01:24:17,222
What in the Sam Hill
are you doing, man?

1003
01:24:17,224 --> 01:24:18,626
Trying to get run oh, oh...

1004
01:24:19,359 --> 01:24:20,360
What's your name?

1005
01:24:21,563 --> 01:24:22,496
Your name!

1006
01:24:22,664 --> 01:24:23,631
Marv, Marvin.

1007
01:24:24,331 --> 01:24:26,433
Okay, Marv, Marvin.

1008
01:24:28,068 --> 01:24:29,303
I'm gonna give you a choice.

1009
01:24:30,772 --> 01:24:31,839
You drive me to town,

1010
01:24:33,473 --> 01:24:34,676
or I can shoot you dead.

1011
01:24:36,243 --> 01:24:37,177
Uh...

1012
01:24:37,344 --> 01:24:38,378
Hop in?

1013
01:24:40,280 --> 01:24:41,181
Good call.

1014
01:24:55,863 --> 01:24:57,799
[Gasping]

1015
01:25:33,166 --> 01:25:34,636
Thank God.

1016
01:25:58,191 --> 01:26:00,561
[Grunting, coughing]

1017
01:26:23,350 --> 01:26:24,919
Ahhh!

1018
01:26:32,259 --> 01:26:33,226
Come on.

1019
01:26:34,294 --> 01:26:35,262
[Starter clicking]
Come on!

1020
01:26:37,598 --> 01:26:38,566
Damn it!

1021
01:26:47,474 --> 01:26:48,576
[Engine starting]

1022
01:26:49,409 --> 01:26:51,244
Yes! Yes!

1023
01:26:53,748 --> 01:26:55,449
[Energetic music]

1024
01:27:12,667 --> 01:27:14,602
Good day at the lake, Marv?

1025
01:27:15,536 --> 01:27:18,906
You're not gonna take
my catch, are you?

1026
01:27:21,976 --> 01:27:24,244
Just keep your
hands on ten and two

1027
01:27:25,479 --> 01:27:27,849
and let me know if there's
anyone behind us.

1028
01:27:29,917 --> 01:27:31,586
[Peaceful music]

1029
01:27:33,654 --> 01:27:34,589
Don't.

1030
01:27:35,590 --> 01:27:36,724
I like that song.

1031
01:28:30,011 --> 01:28:32,312
[Peaceful music]

1032
01:29:19,093 --> 01:29:21,128
[Low military drums]

1033
01:29:30,705 --> 01:29:33,406
I said...
ten and two, Marv.

1034
01:29:33,808 --> 01:29:36,711
You told me to wake
you if I saw somebody.

1035
01:29:42,016 --> 01:29:43,483
[Ominous tone]

1036
01:29:47,822 --> 01:29:49,657
You got a cell phone, Marv?

1037
01:29:55,029 --> 01:29:57,765
Local calls only, right?

1038
01:30:00,835 --> 01:30:03,871
[Dialing... ringing]

1039
01:30:09,476 --> 01:30:12,412
[Dialing... ringing]

1040
01:30:12,947 --> 01:30:15,616
Blackhog One to Blackhog Base.

1041
01:30:15,783 --> 01:30:17,752
Zero One Bravo...

1042
01:30:17,919 --> 01:30:19,452
Tango Three Zulu.

1043
01:30:20,955 --> 01:30:23,423
This is Taylor to
Blackhog Base.

1044
01:30:23,658 --> 01:30:24,558
You copy?

1045
01:30:25,458 --> 01:30:26,594
State your designation.

1046
01:30:27,828 --> 01:30:30,765
Zer...One.. Bravo.. tang...

1047
01:30:31,599 --> 01:30:32,600
Lu.

1048
01:30:32,900 --> 01:30:33,799
God damn it!

1049
01:30:33,801 --> 01:30:34,702
Give me Hiller.

1050
01:30:35,836 --> 01:30:36,938
It's no use, Ma'am.

1051
01:30:39,840 --> 01:30:41,472
Blackhog Base to Blackhog One.

1052
01:30:41,474 --> 01:30:42,209
What is your status?

1053
01:30:43,476 --> 01:30:44,477
Thank God.

1054
01:30:44,912 --> 01:30:46,847
Hiller, this is Taylor.

1055
01:30:47,782 --> 01:30:48,883
I'm on highway three,

1056
01:30:50,584 --> 01:30:52,753
approx... 15 mile...

1057
01:30:53,220 --> 01:30:56,824
Neandeg.... I'm in pursuit
of a red pickup truck.

1058
01:30:57,124 --> 01:30:58,159
Do you copy?

1059
01:30:58,592 --> 01:30:59,660
Copy, Blackhog One.

1060
01:31:00,661 --> 01:31:01,762
My team is dead.

1061
01:31:02,563 --> 01:31:03,631
Dallas is in the red...

1062
01:31:04,932 --> 01:31:07,868
He's infected with a pathogen

1063
01:31:08,468 --> 01:31:10,871
that spreads through
human contact.

1064
01:31:11,205 --> 01:31:11,870
Say again,

1065
01:31:11,872 --> 01:31:12,873
Blackhog One?

1066
01:31:13,040 --> 01:31:14,273
They knew.

1067
01:31:14,275 --> 01:31:17,745
They knew when it crashed
that you'd go digging around...

1068
01:31:19,046 --> 01:31:22,116
...tear it apart,
including the pilot.

1069
01:31:23,017 --> 01:31:24,018
It was a trap!

1070
01:31:25,886 --> 01:31:27,588
We were the Indians,

1071
01:31:27,955 --> 01:31:31,125
and they gave us diseased
fucking blankets.

1072
01:31:31,959 --> 01:31:33,127
He's infected.

1073
01:31:34,562 --> 01:31:37,665
If he makes it to
town, it's game over.

1074
01:31:37,999 --> 01:31:38,899
You hear me?

1075
01:31:39,066 --> 01:31:40,568
Game over!

1076
01:31:40,835 --> 01:31:42,603
You copy that?!

1077
01:31:44,572 --> 01:31:45,539
Hiller?

1078
01:31:47,108 --> 01:31:48,042
Hiller?!

1079
01:31:48,943 --> 01:31:49,910
Shit!

1080
01:31:51,812 --> 01:31:53,280
[Engine revving]

1081
01:31:55,049 --> 01:31:57,752
[Intense music rising]

1082
01:32:02,156 --> 01:32:03,758
[Loud thud, tire screech]

1083
01:32:04,525 --> 01:32:05,860
Ah, jeez.

1084
01:32:13,000 --> 01:32:16,270
[Gunshots]

1085
01:32:30,851 --> 01:32:33,154
Son of a bitch.
[Gunshots]

1086
01:32:34,255 --> 01:32:37,124
[Tire screech]

1087
01:33:26,006 --> 01:33:27,608
Why won't you quit?
[Gunshots]

1088
01:33:53,367 --> 01:33:54,301
Speed up.

1089
01:33:54,668 --> 01:33:55,803
Drive faster! Lose him!

1090
01:33:55,970 --> 01:33:56,937
It's not a race car.

1091
01:33:58,172 --> 01:33:59,306
Then make it one!

1092
01:34:06,947 --> 01:34:08,949
[Bullet hit, steam hiss]

1093
01:34:17,892 --> 01:34:18,993
No, no,

1094
01:34:20,227 --> 01:34:22,062
Fuck. No!

1095
01:34:23,063 --> 01:34:25,366
[Engine sputtering]

1096
01:34:34,375 --> 01:34:35,342
[Chuckles] It's over.

1097
01:34:36,377 --> 01:34:37,244
Ah...

1098
01:34:41,815 --> 01:34:43,017
[Pats shoulder]
Nice going, Marv.

1099
01:34:43,417 --> 01:34:45,252
Didn't know
you had it in you.

1100
01:34:51,358 --> 01:34:52,826
No matter what happens,

1101
01:34:54,161 --> 01:34:55,796
don't stop.

1102
01:35:07,474 --> 01:35:08,742
Oh, shit.

1103
01:35:25,926 --> 01:35:26,994
Oh! Thank God.

1104
01:35:28,295 --> 01:35:30,030
Oh, oh, Thank God!

1105
01:35:32,299 --> 01:35:34,768
Stop or we will fire!

1106
01:35:44,078 --> 01:35:45,246
I said, don't stop.

1107
01:35:45,746 --> 01:35:47,014
They're gonna kill us!

1108
01:35:50,117 --> 01:35:52,019
What do you think I'm gonna do?

1109
01:36:00,995 --> 01:36:02,496
[Truck horn]

1110
01:36:03,531 --> 01:36:05,332
[Engine revving]

1111
01:36:07,201 --> 01:36:08,135
[Gunshot]

1112
01:36:08,536 --> 01:36:09,870
[Glass breaking, hit]

1113
01:36:17,211 --> 01:36:18,245
Look what you did.

1114
01:36:25,919 --> 01:36:27,121
Well, shit.

1115
01:36:41,802 --> 01:36:43,103
Get out of your vehicle.

1116
01:36:44,471 --> 01:36:46,173
You won't get another warning.

1117
01:36:47,141 --> 01:36:48,543
[Reloading]

1118
01:37:11,265 --> 01:37:12,299
Keep those hands up.

1119
01:37:12,534 --> 01:37:13,967
Walk slowly towards us.

1120
01:37:20,974 --> 01:37:22,443
That's good right there.

1121
01:37:25,513 --> 01:37:27,114
Thank God you got my messages.

1122
01:37:28,449 --> 01:37:29,950
We got both your messages.

1123
01:37:30,884 --> 01:37:31,619
What?

1124
01:37:32,086 --> 01:37:33,621
We found Knight alive.

1125
01:37:34,455 --> 01:37:35,456
He turned on us.

1126
01:37:36,457 --> 01:37:37,456
She's dead.

1127
01:37:37,458 --> 01:37:39,026
Along with the rest of my team.

1128
01:37:39,860 --> 01:37:40,560
Motherfucker!

1129
01:37:40,562 --> 01:37:42,229
Don't you move!

1130
01:37:43,063 --> 01:37:48,400
He destroyed her hard drive and
slaughtered an entire family

1131
01:37:48,402 --> 01:37:49,970
just so he could catch up to me.

1132
01:37:51,606 --> 01:37:52,540
Is that true?

1133
01:37:53,006 --> 01:37:54,308
That's their van.

1134
01:37:55,042 --> 01:37:58,145
You'll find them at a
campground 25 miles back.

1135
01:37:58,479 --> 01:37:59,647
Shot to death.

1136
01:38:00,347 --> 01:38:02,015
You can't believe a
thing that he says.

1137
01:38:02,416 --> 01:38:04,284
Did you kill innocent people?

1138
01:38:05,352 --> 01:38:06,954
I had to.

1139
01:38:07,321 --> 01:38:10,556
Like I said, I don't know if
the Russians got to him or

1140
01:38:10,558 --> 01:38:11,892
someone else.

1141
01:38:12,059 --> 01:38:14,261
But you can't trust this man.

1142
01:38:15,462 --> 01:38:17,498
Colonel MacReady, may I?

1143
01:38:18,265 --> 01:38:19,099
Nice and easy.

1144
01:38:25,507 --> 01:38:26,508
Those are her notes.

1145
01:38:27,474 --> 01:38:28,909
She died for this!

1146
01:38:29,309 --> 01:38:30,277
Everybody did!

1147
01:38:31,145 --> 01:38:32,479
I know how to stop this.

1148
01:38:32,913 --> 01:38:34,148
This is bullshit, Mac.

1149
01:38:35,015 --> 01:38:36,014
I can't believe you'd take the

1150
01:38:36,016 --> 01:38:39,219
word of a traitor over a friend.

1151
01:38:40,053 --> 01:38:42,156
Look at him.
He's barely holding it together!

1152
01:38:42,690 --> 01:38:44,124
That's what this shit does!

1153
01:38:45,459 --> 01:38:48,061
It gets in your
head, it uses you,

1154
01:38:49,129 --> 01:38:50,431
and then it makes you go crazy.

1155
01:38:51,064 --> 01:38:52,299
That's what happened at the lab.

1156
01:38:52,667 --> 01:38:55,637
They take me in, cuff
me, interrogate me.

1157
01:38:56,336 --> 01:38:58,706
I'll tell you
everything I know.

1158
01:38:59,406 --> 01:39:00,307
Hmm?

1159
01:39:02,209 --> 01:39:03,977
Hiller, arrest these men.

1160
01:39:07,047 --> 01:39:08,048
No!
[Fight]

1161
01:39:12,386 --> 01:39:14,021
[Rhythmic percussion]

1162
01:39:38,580 --> 01:39:39,714
[Distorted]
Ahhh!

1163
01:39:46,019 --> 01:39:47,120
Hiller! Arrest them!

1164
01:39:47,321 --> 01:39:48,188
Colonel.

1165
01:39:48,756 --> 01:39:50,023
Delay that order.

1166
01:39:51,492 --> 01:39:52,627
You're not in charge here.

1167
01:39:53,994 --> 01:39:54,729
Is that so?

1168
01:39:57,164 --> 01:39:58,098
Sorry, Colonel.

1169
01:39:59,667 --> 01:40:01,134
We all have our orders.

1170
01:40:03,370 --> 01:40:05,105
Let's see how this plays out.

1171
01:40:23,658 --> 01:40:27,595
[Haunting voice]
You will die...

1172
01:40:30,665 --> 01:40:32,734
See? take a look,
he's infected!

1173
01:40:33,200 --> 01:40:35,068
It spreads through
human contact!

1174
01:40:39,306 --> 01:40:40,240
Ahh!!

1175
01:40:43,076 --> 01:40:44,044
[Stab]

1176
01:40:46,614 --> 01:40:48,716
Not on your best day.

1177
01:40:51,786 --> 01:40:53,487
[Overpowering sound]

1178
01:40:59,426 --> 01:41:00,427
Can you feel it?

1179
01:41:01,529 --> 01:41:02,628
Huh?

1180
01:41:02,630 --> 01:41:05,733
You think this is the only
place they staged this?

1181
01:41:08,803 --> 01:41:10,370
Oh, you're in for a shock.

1182
01:41:10,572 --> 01:41:14,174
This whole world
is in for a shock!

1183
01:41:15,475 --> 01:41:16,410
[Gunshot]

1184
01:41:19,413 --> 01:41:20,648
Kill the host.

1185
01:41:23,751 --> 01:41:24,819
Kill the virus.

1186
01:41:27,522 --> 01:41:29,289
You have to kill us both!

1187
01:41:36,496 --> 01:41:39,634
[UFO powering up from above]

1188
01:41:42,302 --> 01:41:44,304
Yahhh!!!

1189
01:41:50,444 --> 01:41:54,381
[Soldiers screaming]

1190
01:42:03,625 --> 01:42:06,561
Make it stop! Make it stop!

1191
01:42:09,429 --> 01:42:11,131
It's okay, Taylor.

1192
01:42:11,566 --> 01:42:12,600
It's okay.

1193
01:42:15,536 --> 01:42:18,706
I'm not tired anymore.
[Chuckle]

1194
01:42:27,347 --> 01:42:29,483
[Deep, ominous pulses]

1195
01:42:55,475 --> 01:42:58,445
[UFO moving]

1196
01:43:01,949 --> 01:43:04,519
[UFO races away]

1197
01:43:04,952 --> 01:43:07,187
[Music, Military theme]

1198
01:44:40,615 --> 01:44:42,415
[Music, Rock theme]